    "Cost": 18930988,
    "UIName": "Dire Wolf 'Widowmaker LRM'",
    "Id": "mechdef_dire_wolf_DW-WM-LRM",
    "Name": "Dire Wolf Prime",
    "Details": "The configuration of Dire Wolf piloted by Natasha Kerensky at her Trial of Position to test out as a MechWarrior. For long range combat, the ER PPCs are replaced by shoulder-mounted twin LRM-20 launchers with 24 racks, first half being Swarm LRMs and backed up by a Large Pulse Laser mounted in each arm. For close combat, the left torso carries three ER Medium Lasers in triangular configuration in the chest and the stubby LB-X AC/20 with 10 cluster rounds underslung on the right torso. For when things gets dicey, a 'fire and forget' SRM-6 one-shot launcher above cockpit, just aft of the hatch and only 20 double strength heat sinks. This configuration was created just for her Trial of Position and seldom used again.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Long</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.21</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "Direwolf1"
  },
